  m_Text: "<b>! SAVE / LOAD FAILED !</b>\n\nThe game is unable to save or load progress.\n\n<b>COMMON REASONS FOR FAILURE:</b>\n1. Playing directly from a .zip file instead of extracting into a safe folder\n2. Save files, \"Saves\" folder or the directory they're in is set as \"Read Only\"\n\nIf you wish to continue with saving disabled,\npress <b>\"Y\"</b>\nIf you wish to quit,\nPress <b>\"N\"</b>\n\nSorry and thank you for your understanding. :)"
