  m_Text: "Alt fire to shoot a <color=orange>magnet</color> that pulls all nearby <color=orange>nails</color> towards it. \n\nMagnets stick to <color=orange>surfaces</color> and <color=orange>enemies</color> and can be broken with <color=orange>hitscan</color> weapons."
